# Mutation plan for GET/POST /plugins/marketplace and POST /plugins/install_from_url against the
# plugins oracle and its mock Marketplace (parity::marketplace), plus the signature and icon
# corpora (mm-app unit tests).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/marketplace.plan
#
# CONTROL- lines must SURVIVE.
#
# 2026-09-19: 23 run, 21 caught, both controls survived. svg-binary-threshold survived the first
# run: its only 0x08 case sat before the <svg>, where the pattern refuses it anyway. The corpus
# gained a 0x08 inside the element, and the line was caught on re-run.

